  "title": "RakNet: Update encryption state on open_connection_reply_2",
  "description": "This change allows wireshark to properly dissect raknet protocol messages when encrytion is first enabled by open_connection_reply_1, but then disabled by open_connection_reply_2. This is technique often used if the RakNet implementer only wishes to verify the UDP source IP is legitimate (as a cookie must be associated with security enabled), but does not wish to implement full encryption.",
